{"ticker":{"symbol":"272550.KS","name":"삼양패키징","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":9780.0,"change_pct":0.009287925696594534,"market_cap":147369017344.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.05112474437627812,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":17540.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":510,"website":"https://www.samyangpackaging.co.kr","business_summary":"Samyang Packaging Corporation manufactures and sells PET bottles for beverages, food, and various other purposes in South Korea. The company offers heat resistant, heat and pressure resistant, pressure resistant, normal pressure, and special bottles. It is also involved in the PET recycling activities; and aseptic filling business under the Samyang Asepsys brand name. Samyang Packaging Corporation exports its products. The company was founded in 1979 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea. Samyang Packaging Corporation is a subsidiary of Samyang Corporation.","business_summary_ko":"삼양패키징주식회사는 음료, 식품, 기타 다양한 용도로 사용되는 PET병을 국내에서 제조, 판매하는 회사입니다. 내열병, 내열내압병, 내압병, 상압병, 특수병 등을 생산하고 있습니다. 또한 PET 재활용 활동에도 참여하고 있습니다. 삼양아셉시스(Samyang Asepsys)라는 브랜드로 무균충진사업을 하고 있습니다. 삼양포장공사는 제품을 수출하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1979년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 서울에 있습니다. 삼양패키징은 삼양사의 자회사입니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"포장","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":407352726180.0,"operating_income":23696363310.0,"net_income":12090047000.0,"eps":777.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":421668811100.0,"operating_income":32467578510.0,"net_income":25435266110.0,"eps":1611.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":448111536480.0,"operating_income":33757315340.0,"net_income":20440262010.0,"eps":1310.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":420217993580.0,"operating_income":24646789000.0,"net_income":17657382510.0,"eps":1156.0}],"price_hist